        {
          "id": "df651c47-d9a0-4ac4-bfb9-4a533c0b0e66",
          "name": "Resolves a context lineage by coordinates: a source (provider + owner/repo for SCM, or tessl-registry without owner/repo) plus exactly one of slug or occurrence path. `kind` applies only to slug resolution (slug is unique per source and kind); it is ignored for path resolution, since an occurrence path already identifies exactly one lineage regardless of kind. Invalid combinations are rejected with 400.",
